510">Cast </span><span begin="00:32.510" end="00:32.960">like </span><span begin="00:32.960" end="00:33.080">a </span><span begin="00:33.080" end="00:33.830">stone </span><span begin="00:33.830" end="00:34.190">out </span><span begin="00:34.190" end="00:34.400">to </span><span begin="00:34.400" end="00:36.020">sea</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.050" end="00:38.750"><span begin="00:36.050" end="00:36.500">-</span><span begin="00:36.500" end="00:36.950"> </span><span begin="00:36.950" end="00:37.400">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.400" end="00:37.850">sinking</span><span begin="00:37.850" end="00:38.300">-</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.750" end="00:45.890"><span begin="00:38.750" end="00:39.860">Buried </span><span begin="00:39.860" end="00:40.250">my </span><span begin="00:40.250" end="00:40.880">lies </span><span begin="00:40.880" end="00:41.150">and </span><span begin="00:41.150" end="00:41.540">my </span><span begin="00:41.540" end="00:44.930">secrets</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.890" end="00:50.120"><span begin="00:45.890" end="00:46.430">Down </span><span begin="00:46.430" end="00:46.910">where </span><span begin="00:46.910" end="00:47.330">the </span><span begin="00:47.330" end="00:47.840">world </span><span begin="00:47.840" end="00:48.560">never </span><span begin="00:48.560" end="00:48.950">sees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.120" end="00:52.790"><span begin="00:50.120" end="00:50.870">My </span><span begin="00:50.870" end="00:52.010">demons</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.790" end="00:56.540"><span begin="00:52.790" end="00:53.240">And </span><span begin="00:53.240" end="00:53.450">I </span><span begin="00:53.450" end="00:54.170">swear </span><span begin="00:54.170" end="00:54.410">it </span><span begin="00:54.410" end="00:54.980">never </span><span begin="00:54.980" end="00:55.580">had </span><span begin="00:55.580" end="00:56.090">to </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.540">end</span></p><p ttm:agen