 begin="01:14.060" end="01:14.720">Stare </span><span begin="01:14.720" end="01:15.200">down </span><span begin="01:15.200" end="01:15.470">the </span><span begin="01:15.470" end="01:15.980">cliff </span><span begin="01:15.980" end="01:16.280">to </span><span begin="01:16.280" end="01:16.760">my </span><span begin="01:16.760" end="01:17.930">decent</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.930" end="01:26.720"><span begin="01:17.930" end="01:18.650">Into </span><span begin="01:18.650" end="01:19.070">the </span><span begin="01:19.070" end="01:20.150">deep </span><span begin="01:20.150" end="01:21.920">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.720" end="01:37.280"><span begin="01:26.720" end="01:27.050">Into </span><span begin="01:27.050" end="01:29.210">the </span><span begin="01:29.210" end="01:29.300">deep </span><span begin="01:29.300" end="01:29.600">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.280" end="01:44.090"><span begin="01:37.280" end="01:37.790">Am </span><span begin="01:37.790" end="01:38.060">I </span><span begin="01:38.060" end="01:39.140">distraught </span><span begin="01:39.140" end="01:39.440">in </span><span begin="01:39.440" end="01:43.790">deceiving</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.090" end="01:51.170"><span begin="01:44.090" end="01:44.720">Sick </span><span begin="01:44.720" end="01:45.230">thoughts </span><span begin="01:45.230" end="01:45.590">that </span><span begin="01:45.590" end="01:46.160">hang </span><span begin="01:46.160" end="01:46.820">over </span><span begin="01:46.820" end="01:48.110">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.170" end="01:51.830"><span begin="01:51.170" end="01:51.500">With </span><span begin="01:51.500" end="01:51.830">meaning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.830" end="01:54.800"><span begin="01:51.830" end="01:52.070">Feel </span><span begin="01:52.070" end="01:52.220">the </span><span begin="01:52.220" end="01:52.220">*</span><span begin="01:52.220" end="01:52.220">*</span><span begin="01: